    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:670bfe8ff8130f1a57f07394",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼……千代王的表现，\n也能让人感觉到日常的钻研和努力。\n托你的福，我也重新绷紧了神经。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcc2b9b982d98a3ca22aa378124ebe42ad94da2a050388d7544b4a315d8720a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071113.json",
      "json_path": [
