      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58b5d0bd866cd5791d17ff45",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "随着出道战的日子逐渐逼近，\n目白阿尔丹的气势与日俱增，她今天也像是\n在试探着自己的极限般做着最后冲刺……",
      "source_fingerprint": "42221ed0fc841c6cd31430eed16929e4b1b4aee03c46a89d3ff13732b628ca07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3eef96715483175f2fd23e6f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8b9b5f7d8a5e6012d5978f9469dfcb0b8ba9cf1e4b3a12ddfa00cec84018256",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed6559503b8570ce615ee81e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不确定未来是否还有机会……\n再与两位一起奔跑，非常抱歉，\n由于身体的原因，我无法与你们约定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa4651de0ed7572a380f13e44ef37a730eab6c8a19c78559eb8d4ec1aa53e2f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c9c18b039400dff3a9cf64a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹对每场比赛都怀抱着\n沉重的决心，身为她的训练员，\n我自认为是比较清楚这一点的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b49d7a6354f31795e2d94fa94a7fa91eeb07bc58bda987bce387ec37b8ddf0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdfe8e869458434241129acb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，我没想到她连面对\n自己亲密的朋友，都会展现出\n如此强烈的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c090a94e0de95420e12467757d8f190884836dd31eb3977ee75f21942aae82b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df4b1f3ffd2644f618c6c57b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不知道樱花千代王她们\n会如何解读目白阿尔丹的话呢。\n这让我感到有点在意啊──",
      "source_fingerprint": "cca8306f2cd812771c6faf30499bfead9b68f9b7b131b6a7fa737133a490b28c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071113.json",
      "json_path": [
